datasource_default_required in an SSL-mode data source, including a
lowercase `:parameters` keyword: the keyword is matched in any case, so
its defaultless name reports alongside keyword_uppercase.
-- input.ds --
:parameters sLane, nDepth := 3;
:DECLARE sKey;
sKey := sLane + LimsString(nDepth);
:RETURN sKey;
-- format --
:PARAMETERS sLane, nDepth := 3;
:DECLARE sKey;

sKey := sLane + LimsString(nDepth);

:RETURN sKey;
-- diagnostics --
1:1-1:12 error keyword_uppercase: SSL keywords are case-sensitive and must be uppercase: use ':PARAMETERS'
1:13-1:18 error datasource_default_required: Data source parameter 'sLane' needs an inline ':=' default; without one the data source fails when it runs (No default value for one or more parameters)
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
1:1-1:12 error keyword_uppercase: SSL keywords are case-sensitive and must be uppercase: use ':PARAMETERS'
1:13-1:18 error datasource_default_required: Data source parameter 'sLane' needs an inline ':=' default; without one the data source fails when it runs (No default value for one or more parameters)
